    {
      "source": "--- Are you... interested in machines? ---",
      "source_ja": "「…機械に興味があるのか？」",
      "target": "“……기계에 관심이 있나?”",
      "source_ref": [
        "2.335:start.hsp:276007"
      ],
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "english_context_reviewed": true
    },
    {
      "source": "--- Ahaha! Looks like you finally realized that slow is going to die! ---",
      "source_ja": "「ノロマは死ぬ、ってことにようやく気づいたみたいね」",
      "target": "“굼뜨면 죽는다는 걸 이제야 깨달았나 보네.”",
      "source_ref": [
        "2.335:start.hsp:276010"
      ],
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "english_context_reviewed": true
    },
    {
      "source": "--- Elements will be your great power ---",
      "source_ja": "「研鑽せよ。元素は大いなる力を汝にもたらす」",
      "target": "“연마하라. 원소가 그대에게 큰 힘을 주리라.”",
      "source_ref": [
        "2.335:start.hsp:276013"
      ],
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "english_context_reviewed": true
    },
    {
      "source": "--- Mewmewmew! Coconut crab! ---",
      "source_ja": "「たらばがに、すき！！！」",
      "target": "“왕게, 정말 좋아해!!!”",
      "source_ref": [
        "2.335:start.hsp:276016"
      ],
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "english_context_reviewed": true
    },
    {
      "source": "--- Muwahaha! A well-trained body will be your friend until the end! ---",
      "source_ja": "「フハハー！鍛えたボディは最後までお前の味方だっ」",
      "target": "“푸하하! 단련한 육체는 끝까지 네 편이다!”",
      "source_ref": [
        "2.335:start.hsp:276019"
      ],
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "english_context_reviewed": true
    },
    {
      "source": "--- I-I say that I will heal your wounds... ---",
      "source_ja": "「け、怪我を治してあげるって言ってんのよ…」",
      "target": "“다, 다친 데를 치료해 주겠다는 말이야….”",
      "source_ref": [
        "2.335:start.hsp:276022"
      ],
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "english_context_reviewed": true
    },
    {
      "source": "--- I give...vitality... ---",
      "source_ja": "「僕、活力…与える…から」",
      "target": "“내가… 활력을… 줄게.”",
      "source_ref": [
        "2.335:start.hsp:276025"
      ],
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "english_context_reviewed": true
    },
    {
      "source": "--- Yeah~! No matter what you do, it's better to have property, right? ---",
      "source_ja": "「何するにしても資産は有ったほうがええやろ？ウチの出番やん！」",
      "target": "“뭘 하든 밑천은 있어야 안 되겠나? 이럴 때 내 차례 아이가!”",
      "source_ref": [
        "2.335:start.hsp:276028"
      ],
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "english_context_reviewed": true
    },
